name: ['Aisha of Sparks and Smoke', 'Arvinox, the Mind Flail', 'Baldin, Century Herdmaster', 'Bjorna, Nightfall Alchemist', 'Cecily, Haunted Mage', 'Elmar, Ulvenwald Informant', 'Enkira, Hostile Scavenger', "Gisa's Favorite Shovel", 'Gregor, Shrewd Magistrate', "Greymond, Avacyn's Stalwart", 'Hansk, Slayer Zealot', 'Hargilde, Kindly Runechanter', 'Havengul Laboratory // Havengul Mystery', 'Immard, the Stormcleaver', 'Maarika, Brutal Gladiator', 'Malik, Grim Manipulator', 'Othelm, Sigardian Outcast', 'Sophina, Spearsage Deserter', 'Tadeas, Juniper Ascendant', 'The Howling Abomination', 'Vikya, Scorching Stalwart', "Wernog, Rider's Chaplain", 'Zethi, Arcane Blademaster']
